{"id":"39af784c2a45f05e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra.md","title":"有限 GL 框架产生 Magari 代数","display":"thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra — 有限 GL 框架产生 Magari 代数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra","aliases":["72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra"],"display":"thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra — 有限 GL 框架产生 Magari 代数","depends_on":["[[72-df-magari-algebra]]","[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §§2,5, print478,485/PDF490,497; local powerset construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra — 有限 GL 框架产生 Magari 代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6855233de747077\" href=\"?note=f6855233de747077\" title=\"72-df-magari-algebra\">72-df-magari-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §§2,5, print478,485/PDF490,497; local powerset construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 为非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R\\subseteq W^2\\)</span> 传递且非自反；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\subseteq W\">\\(X,Y\\subseteq W\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_R\">\\(\\Box_R\\)</span> 与结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B_R\">\\(\\mathfrak B_R\\)</span> 由下式构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mag}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mag}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f6855233de747077\" href=\"?note=f6855233de747077\" title=\"72-df-magari-algebra\">72-df-magari-algebra</a>。框架性质取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box_R(X):=\\{w\\in W:\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\Rightarrow v\\in X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box_R(X):=\\{w\\in W:\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\Rightarrow v\\in X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B_R:=\\langle\\mathcal P(W),\\varnothing,W,\\cap,\\cup,(X\\mapsto W\\setminus X),\\Box_R\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B_R:=\\langle\\mathcal P(W),\\varnothing,W,\\cap,\\cup,(X\\mapsto W\\setminus X),\\Box_R\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mag}(\\mathcal P(W),\\varnothing,W,\\cap,\\cup,(X\\mapsto W\\setminus X),\\Box_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mag}(\\mathcal P(W),\\varnothing,W,\\cap,\\cup,(X\\mapsto W\\setminus X),\\Box_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保顶和保交由全称量词分配直接成立。设 w 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_R((W\\setminus\\Box_R X)\\cup X)\">\\(\\Box_R((W\\setminus\\Box_R X)\\cup X)\\)</span> 但不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_R X\">\\(\\Box_R X\\)</span>。在 w 的不属于 X 的后继中取极大元 v；传递性使 v 的所有后继属于 X，因此 v 属于 □X；又从 w 的假设得 v 属于 X，矛盾。这验证 Löb 不等式，且覆盖无后继世界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-magari-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"f6855233de747077","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-magari-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-magari-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"f6855233de747077","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W$ 为非空有限集，$R\\subseteq W^2$ 传递且非自反；$X,Y\\subseteq W$。$\\Box_R$ 与结构 $\\mathfrak B_R$ 由下式构造，$\\operatorname{Mag}$ 取 [[72-df-magari-algebra]]。框架性质取 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W$ 为非空有限集，$R\\subseteq W^2$ 传递且非自反；$X,Y\\subseteq W$。$\\Box_R$ 与结构 $\\mathfrak B_R$ 由下式构造，$\\operatorname{Mag}$ 取 [[72-df-magari-algebra]]。框架性质取 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W^2","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\subseteq W","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mag}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_R(X):=\\{w\\in W:\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\Rightarrow v\\in X)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B_R:=\\langle\\mathcal P(W),\\varnothing,W,\\cap,\\cup,(X\\mapsto W\\setminus X),\\Box_R\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mag}(\\mathcal P(W),\\varnothing,W,\\cap,\\cup,(X\\mapsto W\\setminus X),\\Box_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box_R((W\\setminus\\Box_R X)\\cup X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_R X","display":false}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-545","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"}],"outgoing":["f6855233de747077","91aa38d1fd431425"]}